            {
              "p": "A veterinarian pharmaceutical company is testing a new drug to treat an infection among puppies. The puppies are randomly placed into two equally-sized groups. One group will receive the drug and the other group will receive a placebo. The veterinarians monitor the puppies."
            },
            {
              "p": "This is an example of"
            }
